pe":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T07:22:50Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T07:22:50Z","body":"@byronv5 哈哈，我也是通过js让video音量平滑变小，延迟3-4秒，嘴还在动，我只能说体验很差啊，依然是你说你的我说我的，\n做实时演示的时候，那叫一个尴尬，后端的清空流不管用，你清空的时候，实际上这时候，流都已经读出来了，估计在进行运算合成对嘴型，这个时候很难停下来， ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3173547820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3173727473","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510#issuecomment-3173727473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","id":3173727473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOK7UGY869Kzzx","user":{"login":"byronv5","id":5252444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTI0NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5252444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5","html_url":"https://github.com/byronv5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/byronv5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T08:23:06Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T08:23:06Z","body":" \n\n\n\n> [@byronv5](https://github.com/byronv5) 哈哈，我也是通过js让video音量平滑变小，延迟3-4秒，嘴还在动，我只能说体验很差啊，依然是你说你的我说我的， 做实时演示的时候，那叫一个尴尬，后端的清空流不管用，你清空的时候，实际上这时候，流都已经读出来了，估计在进行运算合成对嘴型，这个时候很难停下来，\n\n我的应用场景是用户需要打断然后立即说话，所以我的做法是立即停止声音然后激活ASR，而不是让声音平滑变小，否则会导致用户的声音和数字人的声音有重叠导致意想不到的结果","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3173727473/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3174381937","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510#issuecomment-3174381937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","id":3174381937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOK7UGY869NTlx","user":{"login":"zhengyiwei1987","id":221923520,"node_id":"U_kgDODTpIwA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221923520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987","html_url":"https://github.com/zhengyiwei1987","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T11:33:39Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T11:39:24Z","body":"@byronv5 就在刚刚，我找到了通过程序立即停止说话的地方了，如果用的事wav2lip,那在 lipreal.py 的 inference 方法里\n\n只要设计一个准确一点的说话状态管理器就行了，那个 stopSpeaking 是我加的，只要让他False，数字人立马闭嘴🤣，这个方法我看不懂，猜测是从列队里拉出帧，处理了什么，然后在塞进列队 ，只然后再从 process_frames  方法里拉出来，要是流从 process_frames ，好像就来不及了 ，要做个状态管理器，把帧都丢弃掉就好了，\n\nfor i,res_frame in enumerate(pred):\n                #self.__pushmedia(res_frame,loop,audio_track,video_track)\n                print('stopSpeaking', stopSpeaking)\n                if stopSpeaking:\n                    res_frame_queue.put((res_frame,__mirror_index(length,index),audio_frames[i*2:i*2+2]))\n                    index = index + 1","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3174381937/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3177992948","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510#issuecomment-3177992948","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","id":3177992948,"node_id":"IC_kwDOK7UGY869bFL0","user":{"login":"heyyyyou","id":32932178,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTMyMTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32932178?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou","html_url":"https://github.com/heyyyyou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyyyyou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T07:10:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T07:10:53Z","body":"在lipreal.py的inference函数中，系统的处理流程是这样的： lipreal.py:114-182\n这个方法从音频特征队列(audio_feat_queue)获取数据，进行Wav2Lip模型推理，然后将结果放入结果帧队列(res_frame_queue)，\nstopSpeaking在推理完成但未放入队列前进行控制实现了立即打断，好的思路。","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3177992948/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3223057996","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510#issuecomment-3223057996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","id":3223057996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOK7UGY87AG_ZM","user":{"login":"WThirteen","id":100677199,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgA2Tw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100677199?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen","html_url":"https://github.com/WThirteen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T08:00:50Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T08:00:50Z","body":"有没有大佬把livekit agent接入进来。使用livekit agent的打断逻辑加模型回复，只使用livetalking的human 播放部分。\n目前我能够实现两个应用的交互，还需要将livetalking的视频推送到livekit agent上。这一块还没完成[捂脸]","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3223057996/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3223344513","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510#issuecomment-3223344513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","id":3223344513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOK7UGY87AIFWB","user":{"login":"zhengyiwei1987","id":221923520,"node_id":"U_kgDODTpIwA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221923520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987","html_url":"https://github.com/zhengyiwei1987","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T09:23:17Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T09:23:17Z","body":"@WThirteen 你无论怎么样你只要需要对口型，就都要把livekit的音频流推进来驱动口型，这不本质还是用tts驱动对口型么， 只要进入livetalking ，模型需要实时推理，以现在的架构就很难实现，我是设计了一个task_id的模式，从llm->tts每次请求都生成一个task_id,如果执行打断，就抛弃之前的，即便这样，打断也只能比原来快一点（大概2-3秒，但不会因为llm持续返回句子，一条一条的读），程序原本甚至能够到达5-6秒（基本是读完整个上下游游tts的音频流驱动后的列队，打断时间长短取决于llm断句生成的tts断句），\n\n有时候我真怀疑，为了对口型值得么，哈哈","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3223344513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3226315631","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510#issuecomment-3226315631","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","id":3226315631,"node_id":"IC_kwDOK7UGY87ATatv","user":{"login":"WThirteen","id":100677199,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgA2Tw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100677199?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen","html_url":"https://github.com/WThirteen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T00:54:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T00:54:53Z","body":"> [@WThirteen](https://github.com/WThirteen) 你无论怎么样你只要需要对口型，就都要把livekit的音频流推进来驱动口型，这不本质还是用tts驱动对口型么， 只要进入livetalking ，模型需要实时推理，以现在的架构就很难实现，我是设计了一个task_id的模式，从llm->tts每次请求都生成一个task_id,如果执行打断，就抛弃之前的，即便这样，打断也只能比原来快一点（大概2-3秒，但不会因为llm持续返回句子，一条一条的读），程序原本甚至能够到达5-6秒（基本是读完整个上下游游tts的音频流驱动后的列队，打断时间长短取决于llm断句生成的tts断句），\n> \n> 有时候我真怀疑，为了对口型值得么，哈哈\n\n是的，就是为了对口型。现在接入livekit之后，整体的打断逻辑变成了 llm生成完文本->调用livetalking 语音播报接口，当生成完文本之后才把上一个没讲完的打断。如果是用的私有化部署的模型再加上知识库，这部分就更慢了 ：（","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{