ip，而wav2lip就是语音驱动口型的，本质还是得改进程序的底层架构，否则就只能用js检测麦克风音量让video标签音量变小的妥协办法","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3237858711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/comments/3238781984","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510#issuecomment-3238781984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","id":3238781984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOK7UGY87BC-Qg","user":{"login":"WThirteen","id":100677199,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgA2Tw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100677199?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen","html_url":"https://github.com/WThirteen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WThirteen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-30T00:56:52Z","updated_at":"2025-08-30T00:56:52Z","body":"> [@WThirteen](https://github.com/WThirteen) 这部分我研究过，我大模型用了FASTGPT（不用设计上下文逻辑）,你别说用知识库了，就开启工作流模式，什么都不加节点，速度都要慢0.7-1.2秒，对于实时性很高要求的数字人来说，不合适，只能选用聪明的大模型+尽可能在系统初始提示词上做文章，要求不能太高，这就是豆包目前有ip形象，有语音通话，现在也有视频功能，就是没有开启虚拟ip形象数字人？大厂还搞不定这个？一是对口型确实影响打断和应答效率，即便asr调教的再好，也禁不住对推理口型拖后腿，二是体验提升微乎其微徒增算力。\n> \n> 至于非得私有化查询知识库慢，还是多在界面交互或者动作编排切换上做文章吧，比